# T_SCRE: an item edited and saved, the save answered "-ERR 400" (the
# session has expired): the message, then the form and the item list
# left for the login, after which the next command, the location list,
# runs.
K ENTER CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB CTRL-Y
T Hercules II
K CTRL-S
S EXPIRED
K ENTER
S LOCS
K ESC
